    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sun is fading. Earth is freezing. Humanity must choose: remain in deep underground ANCHORS for generations\u2026 or escape into the unknown-MINMEI planet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Geminum</i>, a sci-fi narrative anthology, players explore the consequences of survival, memory, and sacrifice in a dying solar system. Each chapter is a standalone interactive story, lasting 30\u201345 minutes, with branching choices, immersive dialogue, and emotionally charged moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Two paths of humanity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>HOME</i>: Shelter underground, wait for salvation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AWAY</i>: Sleep in cryostasis, awaken to the burden of colonizing distant stars. <br>Both are valid. Neither is easy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-contained, replayable episodes with deep emotional storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi worldbuilding rooted in existential choice and sacrifice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist gameplay \u2013 no puzzles, just decisions that matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple timelines allow players to revisit what they missed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional side stories, flashbacks, and player co-creation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cTo reach the far shore, we must first build a solid bridge.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geminum</strong> is a quiet epic. A journey not of action, but of introspection\u2014where your legacy is written not in victory, but in what you choose to preserve.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sun is fading. Earth is freezing. Humanity must choose: remain in deep underground ANCHORS for generations\u2026 or escape into the unknown-MINMEI planet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Geminum</i>, a sci-fi narrative anthology, players explore the consequences of survival, memory, and sacrifice in a dying solar system. Each chapter is a standalone interactive story, lasting 30\u201345 minutes, with branching choices, immersive dialogue, and emotionally charged moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Two paths of humanity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>HOME</i>: Shelter underground, wait for salvation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AWAY</i>: Sleep in cryostasis, awaken to the burden of colonizing distant stars. <br>Both are valid. Neither is easy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-contained, replayable episodes with deep emotional storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi worldbuilding rooted in existential choice and sacrifice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist gameplay \u2013 no puzzles, just decisions that matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple timelines allow players to revisit what they missed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional side stories, flashbacks, and player co-creation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cTo reach the far shore, we must first build a solid bridge.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geminum</strong> is a quiet epic. A journey not of action, but of introspection\u2014where your legacy is written not in victory, but in what you choose to preserve.</p>",
